stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initiated : payment request received (US-9, US-10)

    Initiated --> Rejected : insufficient funds, limit exceeded, outside 5-10000 EGP range, velocity block or blocked account (US-9, US-18, US-19, US-21, US-32)
    Initiated --> SentToBiller : checks pass, funds held, biller called (US-9, US-12)

    SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms or TopUpNet callback success (US-9, US-14)
    SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses or TopUpNet callback failed (US-14, US-31)
    SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within 10 seconds (US-30)

    Unknown --> Unknown : re-query after 1, 5 and 15 minutes (US-13)
    Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms (US-11)
    Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses (US-11)

    Failed --> Refunded : held amount released to wallet (US-12, US-31)

    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of Initiated
        Same idempotency key returns the first result
        and creates no second payment (US-10, US-29)
    end note

    note right of Unknown
        Money stays held
        Never refunded automatically (US-13)
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Final state, no transition allowed (US-11)
        A duplicate success callback is ignored and logged (US-34)
    end note